OL,3,GNEWSAPort marks 300 years of clay trade
OL,4,
OL,5,FA port has marked more than 300 years
OL,6,Fof being involved in clay exports
OL,7,Faround the world.
OL,9,FThe Port of Teignmouth in Devon handles
OL,10,Fmore than 160,000 tonnes of clay each
OL,11,Fyear, with shipments reaching markets
OL,12,Fas far afield as South America and
OL,13,FAsia, according to Associated British
OL,14,FPorts (ABP).
OL,16,FFormed some 30 million years ago in the
OL,17,FBovey Basin, Dorset, merchant William
OL,18,FCrawford began exporting the material
OL,19,Fto London in 1726.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
