OL,3,GNEWSAPort marks 300 years of clay trade
OL,4,
OL,5,FNow, 300 years on, Devon's ball clays
OL,6,Fare said to typically make up about 25%
OL,7,Fof the material used to make toilets
OL,8,Fand wash basins.
